    {
      "id": "4m1UFFZwmlo0_121ECIqr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1400.6244361514132,
      "y": -927.9607224237348,
      "width": 359.3197021484375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2002503137,
      "version": 771,
      "versionNonce": 986217386,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1775160343844,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "“A filosofia trata das idéias – idéias\nsobre o mundo, sobre as pessoas,\nidéias sobre o viver (...) A filosofia\nse preocupa de modo geral com o\nmodo como sabemos as coisas e com\no que podemos saber.” (Raeper e\nSmith, 2001: 13)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "HCzuxquBGidKdt68_j0mA",
      "originalText": "“A filosofia trata das idéias – idéias sobre o mundo, sobre as pessoas, idéias sobre o viver (...) A filosofia se preocupa de modo geral com o modo como sabemos as coisas e com o que podemos saber.” (Raeper e Smith, 2001: 13)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vnGIWr_V5uQrDK4KBRAbn",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -1383.2263343447726,
      "y": -1234.933938162667,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
